# A loaded save stands at its saved height where land is layered: the Hall of Origin's upper floor (256) over
# the hall below (48). The zone has no objects; a save there stays upstairs (docs/decisions.md).
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_HALL_OF_ORIGIN 31 52 up
until idle
+0 press up
until position 31 30
+0 release up
until idle
+0 assert state player.y 256
+0 reload
until idle
+0 assert state player.y 256
+0 press down
until position 31 50
+0 release down
until idle
